# community video masters
# The .MOV files off the camera are HEVC and 4K and run to ~170MB; the .mp4s
# and poster frames beside them are what the site imports and what ships, so
# the masters stay local rather than in the history.
src/images/community/videos/*.MOV
src/images/community/videos/*.mov
